 27 - Regular paper submission deadline (estimated)
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: European Conference on Visual Information Pro
 cessing\nWebsite: https://euvip2026.github.io/\nSource URL: https://euvip
 2026.github.io/\nLocation: To be announced\nTopics: Signal Processing\, C
 omputer Vision & Pattern Recognition\, Machine Learning\, Deep Representa
 tion Learning\nSize: S\nSubmission type: Paper-based / visual information
  processing\nConfidence: estimated\nLast checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes:
  No organizer-confirmed 2027 edition was found. Meeting and paper timing 
 are annual planning proxies from 2026's final extended deadline. The next
  first deadline may be earlier\; do not treat a prior extension as guaran
 teed. Website and timezone belong to the previous edition\; location is u
 nannounced.\nScope: Visual information processing across image\, video\, 
 3D\, and unconventional sensing modalities. Its defining areas are comput
 ational imaging\, restoration and enhancement\, coding\, recognition\, mu
 ltimodal fusion\, and subjective/objective quality assessment. Rendering 
 and visualizing data\, human/biometric analysis\, and robust evaluation a
 re recurring strands. An extensive applications list is not treated as eq
 ual coverage of every application domain or every responsible-AI subtopic
 .\nAdditional topics: Multimedia Learning & Retrieval\, Computer Graphics
  & Visualization\, Biometrics & Human Sensing\, Robustness & Safety\nScop
 e sources (2026): https://euvip2026.github.io/C4P.pdf\, https://euvip2026
 .github.io/calls/\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
